2 CONT
2 CONT <pre> Notes on 25 Mar 2012/em:</pre>
2 CONT
2 CONT In the new numbering system from YPS (Yayasan Pangeran Sumedang) the starting person was Ratoe Poetjoek Oemoen as descendants of Dewa Goeroe Adji Poetih, the first king of the Kingdom of Sumedang Larang (Tembong Agung). The number
2 CONC ing system changed:
2 CONT >GG.n-1n-2n-3.n-4n-5n-6 etc
2 CONT   where: GG: Two digits decimalr for Generation; 
2 CONT              n-1n-2n-3n-4n-5n-6 = the individual number in the family starting from Pangeran Geusan Oeloen,
2 CONT                                              separated with dot up to three number, rounded to adjust the number-field
2 CONT                                              in the file.
2 CONT
2 CONT    The descendants of Pangeran Soegih used additional abbreviation (S before the generation number).
2 CONT
2 CONT    Ratoe Poetjoek Oemoen only used generation number.
2 CONT
2 CONT    The path of the Regents follow this Royal path downto to last Regent whose descendants of 
2 CONT    Ratoe Poetjoek Oemoen. Most of names are changed to the new spelling.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Alvin add duplicate of [http://www.geni.com/people/Ratoe-Poetjoek-Oemoen/6000000013467923075 this profile] , will be merged after this path is clear.'''
