1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 27. Al Habib Umar Rahmat al-Faruq [Prince Wirasuta or Ranu Umar Raden Kalijati] He left the royal house of Cirebon to spread Islam and spent 10 years in Ternate before arriving in Tidore in 1656. He married Yaya Ta
2 CONC hana Sari who could who have hailed from Sultan Sai’idi’ ‘s household. They had three children; Idang Juriyah, Abdul Rakiep and Abdul Salam.
2 CONT
2 CONT Left Cirebon in northwest Java in the 17th century for Tidore. Habib Umar Rahmat al-Faruq was a descendant of Sunan Gunung Jati, or Shalif Hidayu Tallah, one of the Wali Songo or a founding Saint. 
