2 CONT
2 CONT Karaeng Tunijallo was the twelfth king of Gowa, replacing his father, Tunibatta . After Three Days Tunibatta was killed in an attack on Bone . After his death, Karaeng (ruler) Tallo Tumenanga ri Makkoayang appointed himself as tum
2 CONC mabicara butta or royal advisor in Gowa. Tumamenang ri Makkoayang appointed Tunijallo as his father's successor.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Karaeng Tunijallo "The King of Gowa"=
