2 CONT '''Note on 6 May 2014/mg:'''  Info from R.Tb Moggi: In book Waosan Babad Galuh, translated by Amman M. Wahju, Published by Pustaka Bandung 2009; Enclosured in diagram 25.1 her name: RA. Mariah putri Rangga Gempol II bin Rangga Ged
2 CONC e (from many sources), in diagram 28.8 based on history of Galuh-Ciamis her name: Mariah alias Nyi Gedeng Muda; and her name (RA Mariah) titled Ratu Rangga Gempol. Based by this verse, also confirmed by R. Alvin A.S. Wirakusumah A
2 CONC dinata, SH; can be asumed with the name MUDA (young) is also alias of NM Ajoe the youngest daughter of Rangga Gempol II.. http://www.geni.com/people/NM-Ajoe/5564471146470070834?through=5563938473650026311
2 CONT
2 CONT '''NOTES in RA Mariah profile'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''(April 8, 2013/em: up 2 generation as child of Rangga Gempol or Pangeran Rangga Gempol I Koesoemadinata III)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note on 6 April 2013/em: '''The position of this profile still not clear (at this present point make gap generation more than 5). In Evaluation Process.''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT Note on 6 April 2013/em: Info from Moggi: In book Waosan Babad Galuh, translated by Amman M. Wahju, Published by Pustaka Bandung 2009; Enclosured in diagram 25.1 her name: RA. Mariah putri Rangga Gempol II bin Rangga Gede (from ma
2 CONC ny sources), in diagram 28.8 based on history of Galuh-Ciamis her name: Mariah alias Nyi Gedeng Muda; also in other parts of the book her name: Nyi Gedeng Murda and her name (RA Mariah) titled Ratu Rangga Gempol.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note on 14 Feb 2013/em: Info from Kancana: In document written by H. Djadja Sukardja for celebration of 357-th anniversary of Kabupaten Ciamis in 1999: Ny. Ms. Mariyah putri Rangga Gempol III. 
2 CONT
