1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He loved to train himself, and left for Gunung Bitung (Bitung Mountain) to meditate (tapa) in the place where his great grandfather used to meditate, Ratu Ponggang Sang Romahiyang. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Raden Panglurah was known to be spiritual, and left the world of pleasure for penitence. He had calm and internal happiness by unity with God - finding the gem of life, in the center of his heart (kegaluhan). 
